  "brand_kit_id": "atelier.design.neutral",
  "few_shot_summary": "ExceptionReviewWorkbench renders a 1280x720 surface with a Queue of 5 exceptions on the left, a DetailView on the right with Resolve (modal-confirm) + Escalate actions, and an ActivityFeed audit strip beneath."
